# Paper forms on the box (W13): kobo-field-forms at http://paper.kobo.local. Edit, then
# `./paper.sh up`. See README.md. The web password is generated per box into
# PAPER_SECRETS, not here.

# Built on the rig from kobo-field-forms at this commit (`./paper.sh build <checkout>`);
# boxes get it from the content pack, like every other image
KFF_IMAGE=kobo-field-forms:66d4c97
# Published on loopback only; the edge nginx serves it as http://paper.kobo.local
PAPER_PORT=8087
PAPER_HOST=paper.kobo.local
PAPER_SECRETS=/root/paper.secrets
# Forms, printed batches, scans and readings (SQLite + files): in the box's backups
PAPER_DATA_DIR=/var/lib/kobo-box/paper
# Where the guide's help links go: the library, which has the Kobo guides offline
PAPER_HELP_URL=http://kobo.local/

# The Kobo account sheets are fetched and submitted with: on the rig the e2e user;
# firstboot.sh makes paper-forms (sees only the forms shared with it) in /etc/kobo-box/paper.env
KOBO_TOKEN_FILE=/root/e2e-token
KOBO_URL=http://kf.kobo.local

# Handwritten text: the box's batch model (Gemma 4 E4B with its mmproj, ai.sh), on the
# network KPI reaches it on. Empty: text is flagged for typing in, choices and numbers
# still read
KFF_VLM_URL=http://llm:8080/v1
